{"id":841846,"title":"06｜Chat和Composer","content":"Chat和Composer是两种不同的开发辅助工具，主要区别在于Chat侧重于代码分析与解释，而Composer则支持自动文件生成与修改。Chat适用于代码库分析、开源项目解析等场景，如目录结构、第三方库使用及功能说明；Composer适合编码任务和文档生成。打开Chat有三种方式：快捷键Ctrl+L、选中代码段点击Chat按钮或在终端选择信息后添加至上下文。同样地，Composer可通过Ctrl+I快捷键或在终端选中内容并选择“to composer”打开。对话框内可增加上下文文件或图片，通过@提示符引用。提交模式分为普通提交与code base提交，后者会结合项目文件进行更深入的分析。Composer具有普通运行与agent模式，后者不仅生成/修改文件还会自动安装依赖、运行并调试代码。对话历史记录可在chat和composer间共享，方便追踪。此外，两者都提供了多种操作按钮以增强用户体验，如复制、应用代码片段等。对于代码错误，Chat和Composer均能提供快速修复建议，极大提升编程效率。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":398565,"user_name":"六厘","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1032757,"ip_address":"吉林","ucode":"1C2D2CF884B0E5","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/c2/35/f44e5b94.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1741682437,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144589,"content":"新版本合并到一起了，通过对话框左下角的选择来区分。ask就是以前的chat，edit是以前的composer normal模式，agent是以前composer的agent模式","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1741687737,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":398565,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"新版本cursor没有composer页面了","like_count":2,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":658341,"discussion_content":"新版本合并到一起了，通过对话框左下角的选择来区分。ask就是以前的chat，edit是以前的composer normal模式，agent是以前composer的agent模式","content_length":88,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1741687737,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussion